        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-22T15:57:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`stepIndex` is just the index into a Renderer\u0027s array of RenderSteps, so will always be between 0 and 3. Since the batch key gets used across pipelines (a good thing), we need value that is more unique or we\u0027ll end up having every 1st RenderStep of a Renderer go into the same batch (if I\u0027m following the code correctly).\n\nGraphicsPipelineDesc is based on the paintParams unique ID and the pointer to the RenderStep (cast to a uintptr_t). Unfortunately that\u0027s 64 bits so doesn\u0027t act as interchangeably in your types as uint32_t does. I wonder if we should just assign a 32-bit unique ID to RenderStep. That\u0027s probably worth doing, I could put that together pretty quick today in another CL.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 521,
        "startChar": 63,
        "endLine": 521,
        "endChar": 72
      },
      "revId": "128f729a28de6a8d6a6fcefd0d3792fad6de8188",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2dbf6543_7ad2b121",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/DrawPass.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 521,
      "author": {
        "id": 13824
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-22T20:44:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, good call, I had forgotten that this part was a bit WIP. I had considered using the RenderStep pointer; would it make sense to make the batch keys 64-bit ints? I don\u0027t have strong feelings about doing that vs. adding a unique ID to RenderSteps.",
      "parentUuid": "b51eb21d_20799462",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 521,
        "startChar": 63,
        "endLine": 521,
        "endChar": 72
      },
      "revId": "128f729a28de6a8d6a6fcefd0d3792fad6de8188",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f5f7fc10_36f26cd1",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/DrawPass.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 521,
